Neroland 2 Modpack License
==========================

Copyright (c) 2026 Dario Maselli ("Neroland"). All Rights Reserved.

"Neroland 2" (the "Pack") means this modpack project as published by the
copyright holder: its configuration files, quest and scene definitions,
scripts, resource overrides, pack manifest, listing text, artwork, the
"Neroland 2" name and logo, and the assembled distribution — but NOT the
individual mods bundled or referenced by it.

"Bundled Mods" means the Neroland mods included in, or referenced by, the
Pack (Neroland Core, Nerospace, NeroTech, NeroLogistics, and every other
Nero mod in the pack). Each Bundled Mod is a separate work distributed under
its own LICENSE and is governed by that licence, not by this one.

"Official Sources" means the distribution channels operated or authorised by
the copyright holder for the Pack, currently:

- CurseForge: <https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/neroland-2>
- Modrinth:   <https://modrinth.com/modpack/neroland-2>
- GitHub:     <https://github.com/Neroland/neroland-2-modpack>

The Pack is source-available, not open source: you can read and learn from
everything in it, but the rights granted below are the only rights granted.

1. WHAT YOU MAY DO (no permission needed)

-----------------------------------------

a) USE & PLAY. Play the Pack in single-player or on any server, private or
   public, free or monetised, provided every copy of each Bundled Mod
   involved was obtained from that mod's own Official Source (pack manifests
   that reference official files by download satisfy this automatically).

b) SERVER PACKS & PRIVATE EDITS. Run the Pack on your own server and adjust
   its configuration, quests, recipes and scripts to suit your community.
   Such private edits may be shared with that server's own players, but must
   not be published as a separate or "custom" pack.

c) CONTENT CREATION & COMMERCIAL USE. Create and monetise videos, streams,
   screenshots, reviews and other content featuring the Pack, and run the
   Pack in commercial settings (e.g. monetised servers or events), provided
   the Pack and its Bundled Mods were obtained from Official Sources.

d) CONTRIBUTIONS. Submit issues and pull requests. By submitting a
   contribution you grant the copyright holder a perpetual, worldwide,
   royalty-free licence to use, modify, distribute and relicense that
   contribution as part of the Pack.

2. WHAT YOU MAY NOT DO (without prior written permission)

-----------------------------------------

a) REDISTRIBUTION. Do not re-upload, mirror, re-host or otherwise
   redistribute the Pack (original or edited) outside the Official Sources,
   under this name or any other name. This includes "rehost" sites and
   publishing an edited copy of the Pack.

b) DERIVATIVE PACKS. Do not publish a modpack derived from the Pack's
   configuration, quests, scripts or artwork.

c) MISREPRESENTATION. Do not claim authorship of the Pack or imply
   endorsement by the copyright holder.

3. BUNDLED MODS

-----------------------------------------

This licence grants no rights whatsoever in the Bundled Mods. Each Bundled
Mod is Copyright (c) 2026 Dario Maselli ("Neroland") and is licensed under
its own LICENSE, available on that mod's CurseForge, Modrinth and GitHub
pages. Where a Bundled Mod's own licence permits its inclusion in modpacks
(as the Neroland mods' licences do, with credit), you may build your own
packs from those individual mods under their terms — you simply may not
re-host or fork *this* Pack under section 2.

